data: {"id": "072762e2dd324f05-thinking-parallel_evidence-958", "run_id": "072762e2dd324f05", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集事实\n1. **Pod 身份**：`aiops-case-v06/workload`，UID `f0ed729b-e64a-4bd6-8065-3af3efc737f8`，调度在 `node2` (10.2.0.50)。\n2. **生命周期状态**：\n    *   Kubernetes 状态为 `Pending` (与 `ContainerCreating` 等待阶段一致)。\n    *   容器 `app` 处于 `Waiting` 状态，原因为 `ContainerCreating`。\n    *   重启次数为 0，说明 Pod 处于首次启动阶段。\n3. **容器配置**：镜像为 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，入口命令为 `python3 -u -c ...`，内存请求/限制为 8Mi/32Mi。\n4. **卷挂载事件**：\n    *   `Warning FailedMount`：`hostPath type check failed: /var/lib/aiops-fixture-", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789127516663, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

