data: {"id": "072762e2dd324f05-final", "run_id": "072762e2dd324f05", "seq": 963, "ts_ms": 1789127533649, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v06/workload` | ContainerCreating | aiops-case-v06/workload Pod 处于 ContainerCreating 状态，无法启动容器 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Pod 状态 | `Pending` (fact-07c1a5d19eb7) | 确认 Pod 处于调度后但无法进入运行期的停滞状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedMount`: hostPath type check failed: `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input` is not a directory (fact-015951d0d94c) | 指出卷挂载失败的根本原因：目标路径类型错误 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedMount`: timed out waiting for the condition (fact-b13fe76dcf5b) | 确认挂载失败导致的时间超时，支撑故障持续存在的事实 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` (fact-2ca546fb9dff) | 观测到容器状态与事件记录一致，均处于等待阶段 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total = 0` (fact-775667bd480a) | 确认无重启行为，排除应用侧因 OOM 或 CrashLoopBackOff 导致的反复 |\n| 6 | K8s Config | 资源规格 | CPU Request 5m, Memory Request 8Mi (fact-1f477edd60a0, fact-c350938909d2) | 排除资源不足（如 Insufficient）导致调度的可能性 |\n\n**证据链印证说明：**\nKubelet 的 `FailedMount` 错误（#2, #3）直接解释了 Pod 状态为何卡在 `Pending`/`ContainerCreating`（#1, #4），且由于挂载阶段失败，容器根本未能启动，因此重启计数为 0 且无日志生成。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod Spec 定义 HostPath 卷 'input' 指向 /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input → 宿主机该路径不存在或类型不匹配 → Kubelet 执行 MountVolume.SetUp 失败，触发 FailedMount 事件 → 容器 'app' 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：**\nPod 挂载的 HostPath 卷指定的路径 `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input` 在宿主机上不存在或不是目录，导致 Kubelet 挂载失败。\n这一事实由 kubelet 事件 `hostPath type check failed`（#2）直接证实。该挂载失败使得容器无法启动，表现为 Pod 状态 `Pending` 及 `ContainerCreating` 等待原因（#1, #4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 55.3s\n├─ 问题定位: 13.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 32.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v06/workload: 32.0s (Evidence 24.7s, RCA 7.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v06/workload**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 55.317, "metrics": {"run_id": "072762e2dd324f05", "mttr": {"value": "55.3s", "seconds": 55.324469804763794, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 55324.469804763794, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 52503.068923950195, "tool_calls": 8, "executed_tool_calls": 8, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 8, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 6133.376121520996, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2569.67782974